{"body":"<div class=\"main-wrap content-wrap\">\n<div class=\"headline\">\n\n<div class=\"img-place-holder\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<\/div>\n\n<div class=\"content-inner\">\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"question\">\n<h2 class=\"question-title\">瞎扯 哈利波特小说刚传入中国时，为啥「哈利」没被翻译成「海瑞」？<\/h2>\n\n<div class=\"answer\">\n\n<div class=\"meta\">\n<img class=\"avatar\" src=\"https:\/\/picx.zhimg.com\/v2-fc734cfcc0b308e24640f9b5a2d2316d_l.jpg?source=8673f162\">\n<span class=\"author\">知乎日报<\/span>\n<a href=\"https:\/\/www.zhihu.com\/question\/None\/answer\/None\" class=\"originUrl\" hidden>查看知乎原文<\/a>\n<\/div>\n\n<div class=\"content\">\n<div>\r\n<div>Q：<a class=\"internal\" href=\"https:\/\/www.zhihu.com\/question\/1953901380088623726\/answer\/2090090374874378984\">​哈利波特小说刚传入中国时，为啥<\/a>「<a class=\"internal\" href=\"https:\/\/www.zhihu.com\/question\/1953901380088623726\/answer\/2090090374874378984\">哈利<\/a>」<a class=\"internal\" href=\"https:\/\/www.zhihu.com\/question\/1953901380088623726\/answer\/2090090374874378984\">没被翻译成<\/a>「<a class=\"internal\" href=\"https:\/\/www.zhihu.com\/question\/1953901380088623726\/answer\/2090090374874378984\">海瑞<\/a>」<a class=\"internal\" href=\"https:\/\/www.zhihu.com\/question\/1953901380088623726\/answer\/2090090374874378984\">？ <\/a>\r\n<blockquote>\r\n<div class=\"css-1gomreu\"><a class=\"UserLink-link\" href=\"https:\/\/www.zhihu.com\/people\/830fa7ec172954823abf6d6118b9c197\" target=\"_blank\">@Nightvale<\/a><\/div>\r\n：<a class=\"RichContent-EntityWord css-b7erz1\" href=\"https:\/\/zhida.zhihu.com\/search?content_id=285386547&amp;content_type=Article&amp;match_order=1&amp;q=%E3%80%8A%E6%91%A9%E8%AF%83%E8%AF%83%E5%88%A9%E8%B7%8B%E6%8D%BA%E7%BD%97%E3%80%8B&amp;zhida_source=entity\" target=\"_blank\">《摩诃诃利跋捺罗》<\/a>讲的是：诃利跋捺罗、醯弥尼羯兰阇、<a class=\"RichContent-EntityWord css-b7erz1\" href=\"https:\/\/zhida.zhihu.com\/search?content_id=285386547&amp;content_type=Article&amp;match_order=1&amp;q=%E7%BD%97%E9%82%A3%E6%AF%97%E8%88%8D%E7%A6%BB&amp;zhida_source=entity\" target=\"_blank\">罗那毗舍离<\/a>三位修士，在<a class=\"RichContent-EntityWord css-b7erz1\" href=\"https:\/\/zhida.zhihu.com\/search?content_id=285386547&amp;content_type=Article&amp;match_order=1&amp;q=%E6%8A%A4%E4%BC%BD%E5%8D%8E%E6%85%88%E9%81%93%E5%9C%BA&amp;zhida_source=entity\" target=\"_blank\">护伽华慈道场<\/a>中，率领羯兰芬陀、赫智跋耆、罗纹羯罗、萨埵提邻的部众，击败佛敌魔，度化无明凡夫，证得菩提的故事。<br>全篇分为七卷，分别为：《诃利跋捺罗与如意宝珠》、《诃利跋捺罗与无明蛇窟》、《诃利跋捺罗与天牢幽囚》、《诃利跋捺罗与三昧火焰杯》、《诃利跋捺罗与<a class=\"RichContent-EntityWord css-b7erz1\" href=\"https:\/\/zhida.zhihu.com\/search?content_id=285386547&amp;content_type=Article&amp;match_order=1&amp;q=%E8%BF%A6%E6%A5%BC%E7%BD%97%E9%87%91%E5%88%9A%E4%BC%97&amp;zhida_source=entity\" target=\"_blank\">迦楼罗金刚众<\/a>》、《诃利跋捺罗与半觉王子》、《诃利跋捺罗与寂灭法器》。完整讲述了入道场 → 破无明 → 度饿鬼 → 历试炼 → 护正法 → 见半觉 → 证菩提的完整修行之路。<\/blockquote>\r\nQ：<a class=\"internal\" href=\"https:\/\/www.zhihu.com\/question\/2072260638768997299\/answer\/2081899317351207414\">可不可以莫名其妙地教我一个知识?<\/a>\r\n<blockquote>\r\n<div class=\"css-1gomreu\"><a class=\"UserLink-link\" href=\"https:\/\/www.zhihu.com\/people\/9919a520783c21e8f32709489ce1d3f1\" target=\"_blank\">@Jason 老师<\/a><\/div>\r\n：上台演讲前，默认台下都是小猪，<br>提前找好一只小猪，<br>讲一会就看它一眼，<br>冲它笑一下，<br>放心，这个场子你控的就会很好。<\/blockquote>\r\n<figure>\r\n<div class=\"RichText-ConditionalImagePortal\"><img class=\"content-image\" src=\"https:\/\/picx.zhimg.com\/v2-0274939a4d80ff2ea97e0a93f086ed35_1440w.jpg\" alt=\"\"><\/div>\r\n<\/figure>\r\nQ：<a class=\"internal\" href=\"https:\/\/www.zhihu.com\/question\/1919688702701045739\/answer\/2087486618760386117\">你们的知乎都是怎么涨到万粉的？<\/a>\r\n<blockquote>\r\n<div class=\"css-1gomreu\"><a class=\"UserLink-link\" href=\"https:\/\/www.zhihu.com\/people\/9a4f71066252abc4ee25cee4ed80a940\" target=\"_blank\">@大模头<\/a><\/div>\r\n：先读个博士，然后教育经历那认证一下。大家一看你是个博士，混得这么惨，同情你就会给你关注。<\/blockquote>\r\nQ：<a class=\"internal\" href=\"https:\/\/www.zhihu.com\/question\/1933268936696271540\/answer\/1999306321128858360\"> 如果战鹰把搞抽象的精力都放在下棋上，会不会也成九段了？<\/a>\r\n<blockquote>\r\n<div class=\"css-1gomreu\"><a class=\"UserLink-link\" href=\"https:\/\/www.zhihu.com\/people\/f20009ecbaa5583ec5f7f0af8e37044c\" target=\"_blank\">@杨子<\/a><\/div>\r\n：柯洁证明了搞抽象并不会影响下棋。<\/blockquote>\r\n<figure>\r\n<div class=\"RichText-ConditionalImagePortal\"><img class=\"content-image\" src=\"https:\/\/pic2.zhimg.com\/v2-720ee5e2b4ca7f075d85e0ebd1e57e4d_1440w.jpg\" alt=\"\"><\/div>\r\n<figcaption> <\/figcaption><\/figure>\r\nQ：<a class=\"internal\" href=\"https:\/\/www.zhihu.com\/question\/1979262378672669988\/answer\/2072998483083145392\">能发一张你认为最意义不明的照片吗?<\/a>\r\n<blockquote>\r\n<div class=\"css-1gomreu\"><a class=\"UserLink-link\" href=\"https:\/\/www.zhihu.com\/people\/ea3884c89b06fe599f437016a66a5db0\" target=\"_blank\">@该当归隐之人<\/a><\/div>\r\n：嗯。网络上各种流行过的企鹅的图片，全认识你可以把自己也加进去了。<\/blockquote>\r\n<figure>\r\n<div class=\"RichText-ConditionalImagePortal\"><img class=\"content-image\" src=\"https:\/\/pic4.zhimg.com\/v2-0db2f9a9f8abee80a343e5f979b301f5_1440w.jpg\" alt=\"\"><\/div>\r\n<figcaption> <\/figcaption><\/figure>\r\n<hr>✨恭喜你发现了（即将成为）知乎最好笑的地方，加入「扯点好笑的」圈子，每天看点段子梗图神回复，一起一本正经地胡说八道吧！\r\n<div class=\"RichText-LinkCardContainer\"><a class=\"LinkCard new css-1a2w32z\" href=\"https:\/\/www.zhihu.com\/ring\/host\/1979586347799950567?tab=new&amp;tab_id=0\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"LinkCard-image\"><img class=\"content-image\" src=\"https:\/\/pic1.zhimg.com\/v2-cc40831259b8877ee1f920e7343d6cae_l.jpg?source=1a5df958\" alt=\"\"><\/span><span class=\"LinkCard-contents\"><span class=\"LinkCard-title two-line\">扯点好笑的<\/span><\/span><\/a><\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n<\/div>\n<\/div><script type=“text\/javascript”>window.daily=true<\/script>","image_hue":"0x66573a","publish_time":1793055598,"title":"瞎扯 · 如何正确地吐槽","url":"https:\/\/daily.zhihu.com\/story\/9793548","image":"https:\/\/pic1.zhimg.com\/v2-2a82eb364121a2b8cd0d8d0e05ecd869.jpg?source=8673f162","share_url":"http:\/\/daily.zhihu.com\/story\/9793548","js":[],"create_time":1792746360,"ga_prefix":"102706","section":{"thumbnail":"https:\/\/picx.zhimg.com\/v2-1f8590dc22328f029e3c2eeb73f7d0c9.jpg?source=8673f162","id":2,"name":"瞎扯"},"images":["https:\/\/picx.zhimg.com\/v2-1f8590dc22328f029e3c2eeb73f7d0c9.jpg?source=8673f162"],"type":0,"id":9793548,"css":["http:\/\/news-at.zhihu.com\/css\/news_qa.auto.css?v=4b3e3"]}